WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.110
 Great planning.

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:02.167
 How was I supposed to know?

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:03.660
I can't see into the future.
I'm not a witch.

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:04.600
 No?

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.426
Then why did you dress like one?

00:00:06.426 --> 00:00:09.807
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.870
 Come on.

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:16.411
What did you expect?

00:00:16.411 --> 00:00:20.481
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:20.481 --> 00:00:21.281
[CRACK]

00:00:21.281 --> 00:00:22.255
[GRUNTS]

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:25.670
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:33.844
You can bring your urgent
matter to me — your king.

00:00:33.844 --> 00:00:36.250
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:37.890
 Hey, let's do "Get Help."

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:38.690
 What?

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:40.060
- "Get Help."
- No.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:41.300
- Come on, you love it.
- I hate it.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:42.350
 It's great.
It works every time.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:43.910
- It's humiliating.
- Do you have a better plan?

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:44.710
 No.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:45.710
 We're doing it.

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.680
 We are not doing "Get Help."

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:49.580
 Get help!

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.420
Please, my brother's dying!

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:52.530
Get help!

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:53.343
Help him!

00:00:53.343 --> 00:00:54.249
[THUD]

00:00:54.249 --> 00:00:55.155
[CLATTERING]

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:57.012
Ah, classic.

00:00:57.012 --> 00:00:59.342
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:59.342 --> 00:01:01.350
 Loki, I've studied
almost every moment

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:02.680
of your entire life.

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:07.410
You've literally stabbed people
in the back, like, 50 times.

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:09.060
 I'll never do it again.

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:10.860
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:11.760
[CLICK]

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:17.510
[MUSIC PLAYING]

